--TEST--
A `replace` whose type does not fit the deprecated method is refused above the method, before any use is written — `rule:attributes/a-deprecation-names-its-replacement-as-code`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Api {
    #[Core\Deprecated(since: "2.0", replace: '$this->label()')]
    public function size(): int { return 1; }

    public function label(): string { return "ten"; }
}
echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0847]: the replacement is `string`, and the deprecated code is `int`
  --> case.nvs:3:46
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
